        <mxCell id="c37" value="&lt;b&gt;The split:&lt;/b&gt; Salesforce records, Actions executes, git is the truth. Exactly two contracts cross the boundary (docs/CONTRACTS.md). Without HUB_* secrets the pipeline runs GitHub-only." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="800" width="1200" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
